<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>FC Online Full-Power ZQW Cross Macro

This macro performs a full-power ZQW cross in the crossing zone using the default in-game key settings. In most situations, ZQW crosses are not intended for nearby teammates, so even with a full power gauge, the game provides a certain amount of positional correction. To ensure the input is recognized as a cross rather than a through pass, it should be used from the crossing zone. No additional gauge timing is required.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 

Uses default in-game key settings.

Performs a full-power ZQW cross. Use in the crossing zone to ensure it registers as a cross instead of a through pass. No manual gauge timing is required.
</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 29 1
KeyDown 20 1
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 400 ms
KeyUp 29 1
KeyUp 20 1
KeyUp 26 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>FIFA 4 Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>